  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The arm-length claws jutting from your armor are your only weapon.</em></p><p><strong>1st Level:</strong> Only a beastheart can wield this weapon. Any weapon ability that deals rolled damage using this weapon deals an extra 1 damage. Additionally, you and your companion gain a +1 bonus to melee distance.</p><p><strong>5th Level:</strong> The weapon's extra damage increases to 2. Additionally, whenever you or your companion grabs a creature or a creature grabs either of you, the creature is [[/apply bleeding save]].</p><p>9<strong>th Level:</strong> The weapon's extra damage increases to 3. Additionally, whenever you or your companion causes a creature to become bleeding or uses an ability that deals damage to a bleeding creature, you can each spend a Recovery.</p>",
